WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.452 --> 00:00:12.499
Roxy her head.

2
00:00:12.519 --> 00:00:15.681
"Why is the Mighty Man actor causing trouble?"

3
00:00:15.701 --> 00:00:19.344
"I think he's trying to fight crime," Mayor Bloom said.

4
00:00:19.364 --> 00:00:22.025
"But he made a mess at Metro Mart."

5
00:00:23.226 --> 00:00:24.067
Roxy sighed.

6
00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:26.489
"I'm on my way."

7
00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.190
Roxy flew fast.

8
00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:31.172
She checked her watch.

9
00:00:31.904 --> 00:00:33.425
"I hope this doesn't take long.

10
00:00:33.606 --> 00:00:35.127
Terrell is coming over at six."

11
00:00:37.589 --> 00:00:39.731
Slime was everywhere inside Metro Mart.

12
00:00:42.393 --> 00:00:44.355
The Mighty Man actor held a teenager.

13
00:00:44.895 --> 00:00:46.517
The teenager was trying to get away.

14
00:00:46.537 --> 00:00:48.779
"Let go of me!"

15
00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:50.720
"Hi, Rocket Girl!"

16
00:00:51.241 --> 00:00:52.081
The actor grinned.

17
00:00:52.101 --> 00:00:54.744
"I'm a superhero now—just like you!"

18
00:00:55.885 --> 00:00:57.286
The store's owner frowned.

19
00:00:57.306 --> 00:00:59.448
"My store is ruined!"

20
00:01:00.768 --> 00:01:02.209
"Where did this slime come from?"

21
00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:03.430
Roxy asked.

22
00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:06.993
Splat! Slime shot from the actor's hand.

23
00:01:07.013 --> 00:01:08.655
"Pretty cool, right?

24
00:01:09.295 --> 00:01:10.716
This kid was stealing soda.

25
00:01:10.956 --> 00:01:11.557
I stopped him."

26
00:01:12.698 --> 00:01:13.859
The store owner groaned.

27
00:01:13.879 --> 00:01:19.483
"I told you—customers can fill their own cups for free on Fridays."

28
00:01:19.503 --> 00:01:21.885
"Yeah!" the teenager said.

29
00:01:22.766 --> 00:01:23.607
Roxy sighed.

30
00:01:24.287 --> 00:01:25.908
"Let him go."

31
00:01:25.928 --> 00:01:29.952
"Fine." The actor released the teenager.

32
00:01:31.084 --> 00:01:32.905
"Your show stinks, Mighty Man!"

33
00:01:33.766 --> 00:01:34.927
The teenager ran away.

34
00:01:34.947 --> 00:01:37.829
"When did you get your slime power?"

35
00:01:38.129 --> 00:01:38.850
Roxy asked.

36
00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:40.971
"Today," the actor said.

37
00:01:42.652 --> 00:01:43.513
Just then Dr.

38
00:01:43.533 --> 00:01:44.794
Chen walked in with the general.

39
00:01:46.575 --> 00:01:47.776
She still had her device.

40
00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:53.840
"Rocket Girl!"

41
00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:54.961
Dr. Chen said.

42
00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:56.802
"It's good to see you again."

43
00:01:56.822 --> 00:01:58.063
"Hi, Dr.

44
00:01:58.103 --> 00:01:59.324
Chen," Roxy said.

45
00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:01.420
The general raised an eyebrow.

46
00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:02.981
"You know each other?"

47
00:02:03.941 --> 00:02:04.641
Roxy grinned.

48
00:02:05.261 --> 00:02:06.802
"We met on the space station."

49
00:02:06.822 --> 00:02:10.643
"This is General Waltz," Dr.

50
00:02:10.683 --> 00:02:11.243
Chen said.

51
00:02:11.263 --> 00:02:14.564
"We're investigating a mysterious energy.

52
00:02:15.384 --> 00:02:17.485
We detected it at Old Misty."

53
00:02:18.405 --> 00:02:19.425
"I was there today!"

54
00:02:19.826 --> 00:02:20.586
the actor said.

55
00:02:22.206 --> 00:02:23.427
Dr. Chen's device beeped.

56
00:02:25.427 --> 00:02:29.360
"I'm detecting the energy in this slime.

57
00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.101
And in you, Mighty Man."

58
00:02:31.121 --> 00:02:34.063
"Cool," the actor said.

59
00:02:34.943 --> 00:02:36.684
The device beeped near Roxy too.

60
00:02:36.704 --> 00:02:39.686
"That's odd," Roxy thought.

61
00:02:40.466 --> 00:02:41.467
Then she looked down.

62
00:02:41.487 --> 00:02:45.569
"Oh! I'm standing in slime.

63
00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:47.871
That's what made it beep," she said.

64
00:02:52.313 --> 00:02:53.674
you come with us, Mighty Man?"

65
00:02:54.034 --> 00:02:55.075
General Waltz asked.

66
00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:57.456
"We want to do some tests at the lab."

67
00:02:58.528 --> 00:02:59.949
The actor puffed out his chest.

68
00:02:59.969 --> 00:03:01.350
"What an honor!

69
00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:02.951
I'm happy to go with you."

70
00:03:04.552 --> 00:03:06.353
The actor and the general went outside.

71
00:03:07.774 --> 00:03:08.835
Dr. Chen sighed.

72
00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:14.979
"This mysterious energy is all over Metro City, Rocket Girl.

73
00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:17.021
It might cause problems."

74
00:03:17.041 --> 00:03:20.183
"It already did cause problems."

75
00:03:20.943 --> 00:03:23.605
Roxy gave the scientist her secret Rocket Girl number.

76
00:03:23.625 --> 00:03:25.626
"Call if you need help.

77
00:03:25.987 --> 00:03:30.026
That number goes right to my—" Roxy looked at her watch and gasped.
